sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as user
  participant CL as claude (this session)
  participant SK as gogo-session-update SKILL
  participant TX as tmux
  participant BD as gogo board (readers)

  Note over U,BD: the drift - one session, two work items over time
  U->>CL: /gogo:done alpha
  CL->>BD: alpha state.md becomes shipped - it moves to the changelog column
  Note over TX: this pane is gogo-done-alpha and the ship-reap spares its own host
  BD-->>U: a live session dot on a CHANGELOG card
  U->>CL: /gogo:plan beta   (same session - new work item)
  CL->>BD: .gogo/work/feature-beta/ appears
  BD-->>U: beta shows NO session - the binding is still the string gogo-done-alpha

  Note over U,BD: the repair, on demand, from inside
  U->>CL: /gogo:session-update        (optionally with an explicit slug)
  CL->>SK: load the skill
  SK->>TX: is $TMUX set
  alt not inside tmux
    SK-->>U: no tmux session to update - nothing done (graceful, never an error)
  else inside tmux
    TX-->>SK: display-message -p '#S' gives gogo-done-alpha
    SK->>SK: target = arg slug, else inferred from THIS conversation, else ask
    Note over SK: the conversation is the evidence the cockpit provably lacks
    SK->>SK: validate the target exists and is NON-terminal
    alt target is shipped or aborted
      SK-->>U: refused - that item has nothing left to drive
    else drivable
      SK->>SK: action = RunnableStatus ? go : plan   (bindAction rule, cited)
      SK->>SK: name = gogo-<action>-<slug>          (launch.sessionName transform)
      SK->>TX: has-session -t "=name"
      alt name already taken by a LIVE session
        TX-->>SK: exists - so suffix -2, -3 like launch.uniqueSession
        Note over SK,TX: measured - renaming onto a live duplicate is REFUSED rc=1
      end
      SK->>TX: rename-session -t "=gogo-done-alpha" gogo-plan-beta
      TX-->>SK: rc=0
      SK-->>U: moved gogo-done-alpha to gogo-plan-beta - beta now owns this session
      TX-->>BD: next 5s tick re-derives every binding from the NAME
      BD-->>U: alpha (changelog) clean - beta shows its live session
    end
  end

  Note over SK,BD: NOTHING is written - not state.md, not the registry, not the lock
  Note over SK,BD: the rename IS the move (0.32.0 D3=A)
